  "title": "Vegetarian Cottage Cheese Patties",
  "description": "Cottage cheese is combined with eggs, rolled oats, wheat germ, onion soup mix, and thyme; formed into patties, fried, and then placed into a baking dish, covered with mushroom soup and baked until bubbly.",
  "authors": [
    "ZOPOOH"
